ta razonable vigoroso)","guid":"-DmLQn94QEOINgVd5TO3sQ","children":[]},{"id":"162","parent":"151","text":"Perla 11 Activol caja del farmaco actividad fisica (reduce ~30% riesgo enfermedades cronicas)","guid":"duyfGn_QR-WtNbSYLuqWbA","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"151","text":"Perla 12 La salud es la funcion (Molina/Nobreo) -> musculo es motor de la vida funcional","guid":"ZbViQGZzQHq6WQ0KSzIrdg","children":[]}]},{"id":"164","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"rEXPLeRiSmGtjnidwJRfQA","children":[{"id":"165","parent":"164","text":"Evaluacion M1","guid":"WQyvW4w5S-2NldMO7gRrZg","children":[{"id":"166","parent":"165","text":"Q2 Sarcopenia EWGSOP2 = masa + fuerza + funcion -> caidas + fracturas + mortalidad (fibras tipo II); no es fisiologico","guid":"qY5FeH6uRqybRFJKB_pkfg","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"165","text":"Q14 Prescripcion ejercicio AM debe ser MULTICOMPONENTE (multimodal) + ESCRITA como farmaco (dosis/frecuencia/intensidad/progresion); duracion sostenida minimo 12 semanas VIVIFRAIL","guid":"ZC_ltin4Rm-nefD5zO6RhQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"168","parent":"164","text":"Evaluacion M2 (relevante para este mapa)","guid":"IIGtpD_QRbqUn-Z4137FYw","children":[{"id":"169","parent":"168","text":"Q12 Ejercicio MULTICOMPONENTE = UNICA intervencion con mayor evidencia para mejorar fragilidad (caminar 15 min/dia insuficiente; suplementacion sin ejercicio no funciona)","guid":"quujNOoFTx-OCESnslp8jg","children":[]}]},{"id":"170","parent":"164","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales)","guid":"f8A5HdCyQEy83q0Ik5Bcaw","children":[{"id":"171","parent":"170","text":"Q4 Sarcopenia = pilar de perdida autonomia -> fuerza progresiva mayor impacto en AVDs (Q14 M2)","guid":"9AsnC1zRSriRPGORp2Cxkw","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"170","text":"Q9 Ejercicio multicomponente = mayor evidencia para mejorar fragilidad (mismo concepto Q12 M2)","guid":"tIfznyyZTteMxBnPscajow","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"173","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales Dr Molina)","guid":"zHeTKQ-1SZyJnmwBwGyhOg","children":[{"id":"174","parent":"173","text":"Cual es el tiempo minimo semanal recomendado por la OMS para actividad aerobica moderada en adultos de 65 anos o mas","guid":"E9lkphu2RbKFz0jH1Dmn_Q","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"173","text":"Con que frecuencia se deben realizar actividades de fortalecimiento muscular que involucren a los grandes grupos musculares","guid":"4VjD8aIaSoSrCGfhXJ2i0w","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"173","text":"Para reducir el riesgo de caidas que tipo de entrenamiento especifico debe integrarse en la rutina segun el National Institute on Aging","guid":"zgchbRNwTmWtY4Jr6cJtKQ","children":[]},{"id":"177","parent":"173","text":"Al prescribir ejercicio de flexibilidad cual es la recomendacion general de duracion para cada estiramiento","guid":"z0sS5oX2RuCM9a_6LnmDpQ","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"173","text":"Que componente es fundamental incluir en la prescripcion para combatir la sarcopenia","guid":"FAHAc53sSS2tkr97LorsCw","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"173","text":"Cual es el metodo mas comun para monitorear la intensidad del esfuerzo de forma subjetiva en esta poblacion","guid":"p28AB3UdQiqXIOlrtHBKCg","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"173","text":"Cual es el orden recomendado para una sesion de ejercicio segura","guid":"ct9fHFNTS2CJT6sD-J0IcQ","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"173","text":"En personas con movilidad reducida la actividad fisica debe enfocarse primordialmente en","guid":"21t-tQB7RAS6UaSdd5KSUg","children":[]}]},{"id":"182","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (oficiales Dr Molina)","guid":"86WDugDzRkCWPfB_vQxVug","children":[{"id":"183","parent":"182","text":"1. Molina JC. Current Pharmaceutical Design 2014;20(18):3025.","guid":"wgbBFSuOSI-xnu5GNmpQjw","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"182","text":"2. Molina JC. Ejercicio y salud mental. Capitulo 37. Tratado de Neuropsicogeriatria. Sociedad Espanola de Geriatria y Gerontologia.","guid":"dST8HZBKSrK4PQKQ96jd4w","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"182","text":"3. Cotman CW, Berchtold NC, Christie LA. Exercise builds brain health: key roles of growth factor cascades and inflammation. University of California, Irvine Institute for Brain Aging and Dementia. Trends Neurosci 2007.","guid":"VHV212_iQz6HSey9M4tZuA","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"182","text":"4. Dishman RK, et al. Obesity 2006;14(3):345-356.","guid":"OHhCZTK0To6xdP36fDSE_A","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"182","text":"5. Erikson KI, et al. Exercise training increases hippocampus size and improves memory. Proc Natl Acad Sci USA 2011;108(7):3017-22.","guid":"_LFkm4K4QaeEsP3I6ekYOQ","children":[]},{"id":"188","parent":"182","text":"6. Liao y cols. Medicine (Baltimore) 2017;96(23).","guid":"4jC-d4CFSY-etf-RRJ4wIQ","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"182","text":"7. Lee J, Jun H. Front Physiol 2019.","guid":"Pk9IM4AYRQOz38SCeEJ-iw","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"182","text":"8. Organizacion Mundial de la Salud. Physical activity. who.int (fact sheet 2021).","guid":"mSPl2j0OSdOQNS3wYRlHmA","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"182","text":"9. VIVIFRAIL. Programa multicomponente. vivifrail.com.","guid":"1d7m6-y2TZiCFbCBiXMkcg","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":191,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Geriatría","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Geriatría","filename":"UTD Manejo Hospitalario de Adultos Mayores-2024","id":"map_161","resolved_references":[]}